media: qcom: camss: vote the SM6375 interconnect paths

Give SM6375 QCM2290's ahb, hf_mnoc and sf_mnoc paths and bandwidths:
it has the same camera NoC masters (CAMNOC_HF on MMRT, CAMNOC_SF on
MMNRT). Without votes the multimedia NoCs run at their keep-alive
minimum once the interconnect driver is there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

